                    """, fontSize:1.6%P)
                }
            }
        }
        group(position:(0, 95), size:(100, 5), origin:top-left){
            pageNote("preserve-aspect-ratio keeps shapes undistorted in any box; regular polygons and squares default to it.")
        }
